sit points, and social infrastructure, Lodha Altus ensures urban convenience. It's more than just a home; it's a luxurious sanctuary above the city.","project_area_range":"889-1713 sq. ft.","carpetArea":"889 - 1713 sqft","possession":"31 Dec 2029","construction_status":"Under construction","avgPrice":"38808","reraId":"P51800077358","configuration":"3 BHK, 4 BHK","configuration_short":"3, 4 BHK","highlights":["Exclusive 3 \u0026 4 BHK ultra-spacious residences with panoramic city views.","Premium lifestyle amenities including a swimming pool and outdoor sports courts.","Lush green surroundings with breathtaking views of Sanjay Gandhi National Park.","Seamless connectivity to major city hubs and key infrastructure.","Designed for modern living, offering a perfect blend of comfort and elegance.","Close proximity to Global Pagoda, adding to the scenic beauty of the location."],"projectType":"Residential"},"AmenitiesProps":{"AmenitiesData":[{"icon":"Chess-And-Carrom-Room","id":151,"name":"Chess and Carrom Room"},{"icon":"Fitness-Center","id":148,"name":"Fitness Center"},{"icon":"gym","id":49,"name":"Gymnasium"},{"icon":"jogging","id":57,"name":"Jogging / Cycle Track"},{"icon":"kids-pool","id":63,"name":"Kids Pool"},{"icon":"Library-And-Business-Centre","id":75,"name":"Library And Business Centre"},{"icon":"Cafeteria","id":87,"name":"Open Air Cafe"},{"icon":"large-green-area","id":103,"name":"Open Lawn Area"},{"icon":"party-hall","id":37,"name":"Party Hall"},{"icon":"Senior-Citizen-Sitout","id":88,"name":"Senior citizen Area"},{"icon":"swimming-pool","id":50,"name":"Swimming Pool"},{"icon":"walking-area","id":100,"name":"Walking Area"}]},"BrochureProps":{"brochure_url":"https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects/lodha-group-lodha-altus-bedroom-1756121614.pdf"},"PaymentPlanDataProps":{"payment_plans":null},"PriceRange":{"Price":""},"BookProperty":{"Banner_id":0,"Banner_image_url":""},"DeveloperInfoProps":{"name":"Lodha Group","logo_url":"https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/171121063046-Lodha.png","description":"Lodha Group, founded in 1980, has established itself as one of the leading and premier real estate developers in Mumbai, India. Over the years, the group has demonstrated unwavering dedication and has expanded its footprint globally, leaving a significant impact on several prominent cities worldwide, including New York, London, Singapore, Shanghai, and Dubai. With a history spanning more than four decades, the Lodha Group has consistently delivered projects characterized by the highest quality, innovation, and architectural excellence. Their contributions have played a pivotal role in transforming the skyline and overall landscape of Mumbai, the financial capital of India.","propertyName":"Lodha Altus"},"PriceFloorPlanProps":{"FloorPlanData":null},"LocalityProps":{"mapProps":{"lat":19.217525494717353,"lng":72.84726746576624,"zoomLevel":15,"markerList":[{"lat":19.217525494717353,"lng":72.84726746576624,"name":"Lodha Altus","address":"","markerAddress":"Lodha Altus, off Swami Vivekananda Road, Om Shree Geetanjali Nagar, Saibaba Nagar, Borivali West, Mumbai, Maharashtra 400092"}]},"placeTypes":[{"type":"hospital","places":[{"name":"✅Sai Sparsh Maternity And Nursing Home-Gynecologist-Obstetrician,High-risk pregnancy,Laparoscopic,Abortion doctor in borivali","numRatings":"","rating":"","distance":"0.1 km","iconName":"","propertyMarker":{"lat":19.2175991,"lng":72.84790679999999,"name":"✅Sai Sparsh Maternity And Nursing Home-Gynecologist-Obstetrician,High-risk pregnancy,Laparoscopic,Abortion doctor in borivali","address":"Haridas Nagar Rd, Om Shree Geetanjali Nagar, Saibaba Nagar, Borivali West, Mumbai"}},{"name":"Navjivan Maternity \u0026 Surgical Home","numRatings":"","rating":"","distance":"0.3 km","iconName":"","propertyMarker":{"lat":19.2174171,"lng":72.8498895,"name":"Navjivan Maternity \u0026 Surgical Home","address":"Building No. 3, Saibaba Mandir Marg, Shastri Nagar, Mulji Nagar, Borivali West, Mumbai"}},{"name":"Sanghvi Hospital","numRa