any questions”","subHeaderText":"One of our RMs will assist you.","contactNumber":"7977272815"},"seoDetails":{"title":"Continue booking Lodha Altus","url":"","slug":"","canonical":"https://blox.xyz/projects/lodha-altus","description":"Continue booking Lodha Altus","imageUrl":"","keyword":"","robots":"noindex, nofollow"},"configId":41064}}},"ReraInfo":{"P51800077358":{"towerName":"Lodha Altus","state":"Maharashtra","label":"MahaRERA (Maharashtra Real Estate Regulatory Authority)","url":"https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in","reraLink":"https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/projects-search-result?certificate_no=P51800077358"}},"BookPropertyEnabled":false,"structuredData":["\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org/\",\n  \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\",\n  \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Mumbai\",\"item\":\"https://blox.xyz/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Properties in Mumbai\",\"item\":\"https://blox.xyz/buy/mumbai/1a256\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Properties in Borivali West\",\"item\":\"https://blox.xyz/buy/mumbai/borivali-west-1a256b7a21\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":4,\"name\":\"Lodha Group\",\"item\":\"https://blox.xyz/buy/mumbai/borivali-west-lodha-group-1a256b7a21b13a32\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":5,\"name\":\"Lodha Altus\",\"item\":\"https://blox.xyz/projects/lodha-altus\"}]\n}","\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\n  \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"When is the possession date for Lodha Altus?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Possession date of Lodha Altus is 31 Dec 2029\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is the RERA carpet area range of Lodha Altus?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"The RERA carpet area range for Lodha Altus is 889 - 1713 sqft\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is the price range of Lodha Altus?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"The price range of Lodha Altus is ₹3.45 Cr - 6.21 Cr\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Where is Lodha Altus located?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Lodha Altus is located at Lodha Altus, off Swami Vivekananda Road, Om Shree Geetanjali Nagar, Saibaba Nagar, Borivali West, Mumbai, Maharashtra 400092.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What configurations are available in Lodha Altus?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Lodha Altus has 3 BHK, 4 BHK configurations.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is the status of Lodha Altus?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"The status of Lodha Altus is Under construction.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Which amenities are provided in Lodha Altus?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"The amenities are Chess and Carrom Room, Fitness Center, Gymnasium, Jogging / Cycle Track, Kids Pool, Library And Business Centre, Open Air Cafe, Open Lawn Area, Party Hall, Senior citizen Area, Swimming Pool, Walking Area.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Who is the developer of Lodha Altus?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"The developer of Lodha Altus is Lodha Group.\"}}]\n}\n","\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"Product\",\n  \"name\": \"Lodha Altus\",\n  \"image\": \"https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/171121063046-Lodha.png\",\n  \"description\": \"Lodha Altus by Lodha Group is a high-end residential development situated in the sought-after neighborhood of Borivali West, Mumbai. It features ultra-spacious 3- and 4-BHK residences that offer breathtaking panoramic views of the city. These thoughtfully designed homes cater to those with a taste for refined living, blending opulence, privacy, and functionality. The project stands tall with architectural elegance and is equipped with premium lifestyle amenities. With seamless access to major roads, transit points, and social infrastructure, Lodha Altus ensures urban convenience. It's more than just a home; it's a luxurious sanctuary above the city.\",\n  \"brand\": {\n\t\t\"@type\": \"Brand\",\n\t\t\"name\": \"Lodha Group\"\n\t},\n  \"offers\": {\n\t\t\"@type\": \"AggregateOffer\",\n    \"url\": \"https://blox.xyz/projects/lodha-altus\",\n\t\t\"priceCurrency\": \"INR\",\n\t\t\"lowPrice\": \"34500000.00\",\n\t\t\"highPrice\": \"62100000.00\"\n\t}\n}\n","\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": [\n      \"SingleFamilyResidence\",\n      \"Product\",\n      \"RealEstateListing\"\n  ],\n  \"@id\": \"https://blox.xyz/projects/lodha-altus\",\n  \"mpn\": \"P51800077358\",\n  \"brand\": {\n    \"@type\": \"Brand\",\n    \"@id\": \"https://blox.xyz/buy/mumbai/lodha-group-1a256b13a32\",\n    \"name\": \"Lodha Group\"\n  },\n  \"url\": \"https://blox.xyz/projects/lodha-altus\",\n  \"containedInPlace\": {\n      \"@type\": \"Place\",\n      \"@id\": \"Lodha Altus\",\n      \"url\": \"https://blox.xyz/projects/lodha-altus\",\n      \"name\": \"Lodha Altus\",\n      \"address\": {\n          \"@type\": \"PostalAddress\",\n          \"streetAddress\": \"Lodha Altus, off Swami Vivekananda Road, Om Shree Geetanjali Nagar, Saibaba Nagar, Borivali West, Mumbai, Maharashtra 400092\",\n          \"addressLocality\": \"Borivali West\",\n          \"addressRegion\": \"Mumbai\",\n          \"postalCode\": \"400092\",\n          \"addressCountry\": \"IN\"\n      }\n  },\n  \"description\": \"Lodha Altus by Lodha Group is a high-end residential development situated in the sought-after neighborhood of Borivali West, Mumbai. It features ultra-spacious 3- and 4-BHK residences that offer breathtaking panoramic views of the city. These thoughtfully designed homes cater to those with a taste for refined living, blending opulence, privacy, and functionality. The project stands tall with architectural elegance and is equipped with premium lifestyle amenities. With seamless access to major roads, transit points, and social infrastructure, Lodha Altus ensures urban convenience. It's more than just a home; it's a luxurious sanctuary above the city.\",\n  \"floorSize\": [\n      {\n          \"@type\": \"QuantitativeValue\",\n          \"unitCode\": \"SQFT\",\n          \"minValue\": \"889\",\n          \"maxValue\": \"1713\"\n      }\n  ],\n  \"image\": [\n      {\n          \"@type\": \"ImageObject\",\n          \"url\": \"https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/171121063046-Lodha.png\"\n      }\n  ],\n  \"name\": \"Lodha Altus\",\n  \"offers\": {\n      \"@type\": \"Offer\",\n      \"@id\": \"P51800077358\",\n      \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\",\n      \"name\": \"Sale of Lodha Altus Unit\",\n      \"url\": \"https://blox.xyz/projects/lodha-altus\",\n      \"price\": 34500000.00,\n      \"priceCurrency\": \"INR\"\n  }\n}\n"],"aiReviewSummary":{"summary":"Summary of Online Reviews Brand Trust: Visitors frequently mention the developer's reputation for high construction standards and reliable delivery timelines as a primary reason for their interest. Prime Location: The project is highly rated for its placement in a serene residential pocket of Saibaba Nagar while remaining close to essential urban infrastructure. Spacious Units: Many reviewers appreciate the offering of larger 3 and 4 BHK configurations, which are becoming increasingly rare in the Borivali micro-market. Modern Amenities: Early feedback highlights the comprehensive range of facilities, including the clubhouse and open spaces, as a significant draw for families.","pros":[{"title":"Connectivity","description":"The site offers quick access to S.V. Road, the Western Express Highway, and nearby metro stations for easy commuting."},{"title":"Open Spaces","description":"Approximately 85 percent of the 1.7-acre land parcel is dedicated to open greenery and lifestyle amenities."},{"title":"Scenic Views","description":"Higher floors are expected to provide clear views of the Sanjay Gandhi National Park and the Global Pagoda."},{"title":"Gated Security","description":"The project features a robust 5-tier security system and advanced safety measures for residents."},{"title":"Neighborhood Quality","description":"The surrounding area is well-developed with established schools, hospitals, and high-street retail in the immediate vicinity."}],"cons":[{"title":"Price Premium","description":"The project is priced at a significant premium compared to older cooperative housing societies in the same locality."},{"title":"Possession Timeline","description":"With completion scheduled for 2028 or 2029, it is not suitable for buyers looking for immediate move-in options."},{"title":"Construction Noise","description":"Ongoing work in the developing neighborhood may lead to temporary dust and noise for the next few years."},{"title":"Layout Efficiency","description":"Some feedback suggests that specific unit plans have unoptimized passage areas that reduce the effective usable carpet area."},{"title":"Traffic Congestion","description":"While the internal roads are tree-lined, the main approach roads to Borivali West experience heavy traffic during peak hours."}],"verdict":["Ideal for luxury seekers","Great for multi-generational families","High long-term appreciation potential","Avoid if seeking immediate possession","Premium pricing for brand value"]},"googleReviews":{"html_attributions":[],"result":{"rating":4,"reviews":[{"author_name":"Itchy Mind","author_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108460386826327797747/reviews","language":"en","original_language":"en","profile_photo_url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXkDXEPhREjnhKhhc10yR5-S9KjPgm5pXbkkVfcAoUgKFJHp7I6=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4","rating":5,"relative_time_description":"4 months ago","text":"Its an under development project of 4.5 bhk to 3 bhk apartment.\n\nLuxurious \u0026 spacious project","time":1776581582,"translated":false},{"author_name":"ronak varma","author_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110297049351324188092/reviews","language":"en","original_language":"en","profile_photo_url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVZ7jyIcfoOv2ZnqfEJR1763xHyqEBU6u6jIy_2xUNNr4P4NCDb=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3","rating":1,"relative_time_description":"5 months ago","text":"Worst sales team ever. The fact that they know that people will buy apartments no matter how they treat them just shows in their behaviour.","time":1773840565,"translated":false},{"author_name":"Shikhar Shah","author_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109682312823637253030/reviews","language":"en","original_language":"en","profile_photo_url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLm04VzQwDAHEl-N2ykUj2FI7hBV1JQn4C-Ol81Ol5daPSp6g=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo","rating":1,"relative_time_description":"10 months ago","text":"The bald guy in the Sales team is so egotistic. Lol, he doesn’t know how to talk, he thinks he is smart but honestly he sucks at his job. He lacks professionalism overall. Though, other sales people are still decent.","time":1761533871,"translated":false},{"author_name":"Ruchita Mhatre","author_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110803108568609142053/reviews","language":"en","original_language":"en","profile_photo_url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW63luLbBVDkAXeEpmiZ1q79SCx7cyGXGWfq9WrWjGKqNaokRI=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3","rating":1,"relative_time_description":"a year ago","text":"We visited lodha properties in Lokhandwala in search of 2bhk before coming across this site. While we were passing by, we saw this new construction \u0026 thought of giving a visit, but our experience turned out to be terrible.\nNo one was even taking initiative to show the inventories. My parents were told that they only have 3\u00264bhk however nothing is available, everything is Sold off; plus they were being judged \u0026 no one seemed interested. This kind of inhuman behaviour where one makes other feel low \u0026 bad is highly unacceptable.\nTreatment received via Lodha group was unprofessional \u0026 unethical. Lodha needs to hire people with class, kindness \u0026 professionalism, and stop judging clients from top to bottom.","time":1730384587,"translated":false},{"author_name":"amit shah","author_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102818774824109338460/reviews","language":"en","original_language":"en","profile_photo_url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJtj-JHaR0i0ADjX4F0lXXw1UIK030OeI-O81Hf9txuP8pJHA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4","rating":3,"relative_time_description":"a year ago","text":"Landmark project in the good gujju locality of saibaba nagar.\n\nSample flat is available and good with premium quality..\n\nSpread across approx 2 acre plot..\n\nGood organised way to deal customer with process driven approach.. No negotiations all at fixed terms only..\n\nNo sales brochure, project plan given to customer... All models and plans digitally shown\n\nMonopolistic practice found..but trustworthy developer with faster execution","time":1727346962,"translated":false}],"url":"https://maps.google.com/?cid=17140721317822101693","user_ratings_total":22},"status":"OK"}},"isMobile":false,"footerData":{"featured":{"kolkata":{"label":"Kolkata","id":14},"mumbai":{"label":"Mumbai","id":256},"navi-mumbai":{"label":"Navi Mumbai","id":261},"pune":{"label":"Pune","id":300},"thane":{"label":"Thane","id":269}},"others":{"alibaug":{"label":"Alibaug","id":1907},"bangalore":{"label":"Bangalore","id":95},"noida":{"label":"Noida","id":84},"palghar":{"label":"Palghar","id":264},"raigad":{"label":"Raigad","id":3323},"telangana":{"label":"Telangana","id":3326}}},"__N_SSP":true},"page":"/projects/[project_name]","query":{"project_name":"lodha-altus"},"buildId":"t4LZHlTlBLViwyNa5GApO","isFallback":false,"gssp":true,"appGip":true,"scriptLoader":[]}</script></body></html>